{"description":"When .gitignore is edited, verify that .kiro is not ignored. Kiroween 2026 rules require the /.kiro directory at the repo root to be visible in the public repository; ignoring it can disqualify the submission.","name":"Guard: never gitignore the .kiro directory","then":{"prompt":"The .gitignore file just changed. Read it and confirm that no rule matches the .kiro directory (no '.kiro', '.kiro/', '/.kiro', or wildcard that would cover it, and no negation games that hide it). If any rule would ignore .kiro, remove that rule and tell me you did. If .gitignore is clean, do nothing.","type":"askAgent"},"version":"1.0","when":{"patterns":[".gitignore"],"type":"fileEdited"}}